. * ---------- (A) pre / post 2010 split ----------
. foreach yv in g_int g_vol g_gdp {
  2.     ivreghdfe `yv' lnpop (ln_gaci_cwm = tourism_int) if y<2010, ///
>         absorb(isocode y) robust
  3.     eststo pre_`yv'
  4.     estadd scalar KPF = e(widstat)
  5. 
.     ivreghdfe `yv' lnpop (ln_gaci_cwm = tourism_int) if y>=2010, ///
>         absorb(isocode y) robust
  6.     eststo post_`yv'
  7.     estadd scalar KPF = e(widstat)
  8. }
(MWFE estimator converged in 5 iterations)

